      "Whether the Ajanta-Ellora heritage-tourism economy - guiding, hospitality, or conservation-adjacent work - is a genuine fit for your interests and skills, or a distraction from a stronger direction",
      "What a realistic income trajectory looks like on your current path, given how thin or thick Aurangabad's local market actually is for that specific skill",
    ],
