      "It is specific, and that is exactly why it belongs in the conversation. Marathwada's real exposure to monsoon failure and crop-price swings is a genuine, common reason many Aurangabad families want the next generation on a stable skill-based income path. Good counselling should treat that pressure directly rather than defaulting to generic advice written for a region without it.",
