      "It is a genuine, if smaller and more seasonal, career layer - licensed tour-guiding, hospitality and hotel operations, and conservation-adjacent work connected to two UNESCO World Heritage Sites in the same district. Whether it fits you depends on your own language ability, service orientation, and interest in cultural and historical depth, which is exactly what counselling should help clarify.",
  },
  {
    question: "Are the career and skill assessments free?",
    answer: "Yes. The career and skill assessments are fully free, updated, practical, and AI-powered.",
  },
  {
    question: "Can this help students, freshers, and working professionals in Aurangabad?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Future Career School serves students, freshers, and working professionals across school, college, recent-graduate, postgraduate, and career-growth stages. The guidance is online across India, so it works whether you are based in Aurangabad, studying at Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Marathwada University, working near Waluj or Chikalthana, or weighing a move to a bigger city.",
  },
  {
    question: "What if I searched for Aurangabad but the bigger issue is not the city at all?",
    answer:
      "That is common - a city search is often a trust shortcut. If the real pressure is stream selection, degree choice, skill direction, or a career change rather than location, the main counselling and guidance pages are the stronger next filter. This page is most useful when local context - Marathwada's farm-income pressure, the Waluj-Chikalthana industrial belt, or the Ajanta-Ellora heritage economy - is genuinely part of your decision.",
  },
];

const faqJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  mainEntity: faqItems.map((item) => ({
    "@type": "Question",
    name: item.question,
    acceptedAnswer: {
      "@type": "Answer",
      text: item.answer,
    },
  })),
};

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    itemListElement: [
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: "https://futurecareerschool.com/" },
