      "Career counselling in Aurangabad, also known as Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar, for students, freshers, and working professionals. Online guidance for Marathwada's farm-income pressure, the Waluj-Chikalthana auto and pharma manufacturing belt, and the Ajanta-Ellora heritage-tourism economy.",
    url: canonical,
    serviceType: "Career Counselling and Career Guidance",
    areaServed: [
      { "@type": "City", name: "Aurangabad" },
      { "@type": "City", name: "Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar" },
      { "@type": "Country", name: "India" },
    ],
    inLanguage: "en-IN",
    provider: {
      "@type": ["Organization", "ProfessionalService"],
