---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} jsonLd={jsonLd}>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.guidanceLocations}>Locations</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Career Counselling in Aurangabad</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Practical support for students, freshers, and working professionals in Aurangabad
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career counselling in Aurangabad
        <span class="gold-text"> for Marathwada's real forks</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Aurangabad, officially renamed Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar in 2023 but still the name most people search and use, sits at the centre of
        Marathwada - a historically drought-prone, farm-dependent region where an unreliable monsoon still pushes many families toward a stable
        professional or salaried skill path rather than land alone. That same city is also home to a genuine auto-ancillary and pharmaceutical
        manufacturing belt across Waluj and Chikalthana, and to the Ajanta and Ellora Caves - two UNESCO World Heritage Sites in the same district
        supporting a real heritage-tourism career layer. Good career counselling here means building the kind of high-value skill portfolio that
        keeps unlocking high income opportunities across whichever of those paths genuinely fits you, not generic advice written for a region
        without Marathwada's specific pressures.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-note">
        Guidance is delivered fully online in Aurangabad and across India. You can start from home, from Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Marathwada
        University or another campus, or from work near Waluj or Chikalthana - no travel required before the underlying skill direction is even
        clear.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Counselling</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Counselling</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-support">
        The stronger filter is not whether Aurangabad's industrial or tourism growth sounds promising in general. It is whether your specific
        skill direction already has a real opening here, and whether it moves you toward earlier financial freedom faster than the default your
        family or neighbourhood expects.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="aurangabad-career-landscape"
    title="The Aurangabad career reality generic tier-2-city advice misses"
    subtitle="Aurangabad is not simply a farm-belt city or simply an industrial one - it carries a genuine agrarian hinterland, a real manufacturing base, and a distinct heritage-tourism economy at once. Good career counselling should help you build the high-value skill portfolio that unlocks high income opportunities from whichever of these paths actually fits you."
    items={aurangabadContextItems}
    variant="signal"
  />

  <BofuFeatureSection
    sectionId="ajanta-ellora-heritage-economy"
    title="Ajanta, Ellora, and Paithan give Aurangabad a career layer no other city page on this site carries"
    subtitle="Two UNESCO World Heritage Sites and a recognised handloom-craft tradition sit inside this one district, supporting real, specific work most outside guidance never accounts for."
    items={heritageTourismItems}
    variant="decision"
  />

  <BofuListCardSection
    sectionId="marathwada-fork"
    title="Farm pressure, the industrial belt, or heritage tourism - the real fork behind most Aurangabad searches"
    subtitle="This is the decision most Aurangabad and wider-Marathwada families actually face, and it has no equivalent framing anywhere else on this site: whether to move away from volatile farm income toward a stable skill-based path, build inside the Waluj-Chikalthana auto-ancillary and pharma cluster, or take the Ajanta-Ellora heritage-tourism economy seriously as a genuine third option."
