  />

  <ComparisonMatrix
    sectionId="comparison"
    title="How this approach differs from typical career counselling"
    subtitle="In a city where the farm-belt reputation, the industrial-belt story, and the heritage-tourism economy all hold some truth, the risk is generic advice that only knows one script. The comparison below shows what separates high-leverage guidance from that."
